      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The beheaded's previous action was a horn Strike that dealt damage to its target</p><hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The beheaded tosses its head, attempting to move the target creature into another space within reach of its horns. It rolls an athletics|defense:fortitude check against the target's Fortitude DC. On a failure, the target remains in place.</p>",
